# Writing in Russian: дорога́я Ма́ша
subtitle: "Begin and end a message in Russian: дорога́я Ма́ша, обнима́ю, целу́ю, до встре́чи and пиши́ for friends, с уваже́нием for вы, and a short letter to read."
tags: ["russian","writing in russian","russian letters","russian messages","russian phrases"]
teaches: ["phrases/writing-messages"]
thumb: "band \"Dear Masha, in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"The weather forecast in Russian: ми́нус де́сять","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/96-russian-forecast.cast"}

